+\[
+ P_{i-1}=P_i^{q_i}-P_{i+1}.                         \tag{2.9}
+\]
+
+It expresses every `P_i`, hence `x,y`, as a polynomial in `T`. At the
+unique point `T=infinity`, let `n_i` be the pole order of `P_i`. Then
+
+\[
+ n_{s-1}=1,
