+
+\[
+ (\rho,\nu,\bar\kappa)=(1,2,5)
+ \longmapsto (2,q,2q+2),
+\]
+
+and then
+
+\[
+ (2,q,2q+2)\longmapsto(2,q',2q'+2),
+ \qquad q,q'\ge2.                                  \tag{1.1}
+\]
+
+For `q=q'=2`, every step fixes
