+
+In the counterexample normal form, type `(alpha,beta)` fixes only the
+reduced degree ratio. It does not bound the common degree scale `B`.
+Lemma 2.2 spends that scale on the inserted carriers. KJN bounds `td`, not
+`B`.
+
